BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_312553964@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044829Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T173000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260625T190000
SUMMARY:THIRSTY THURSDAY New Member Social for Sonoma County Women's Wine 
 Club
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nThis is our regular c
 lub meeting\, held on the last Thursday of every month except for holidays
  and we are super excited! Come join us at 4th Street Cellars in downtown 
 Santa Rosa. They have generously offered to host our monthly THIRSTY THURS
 DAY social for us.\n\nIf you are new to the area\, or just looking to get 
 out of the house and make new friends\, this is the place for you. Welcomi
 ng to ALL new and (ahem\, old) members.\n\nWine is purchased by the glass 
 for a set fee of $13/$14 per glass with the variety of white\, rosé\, and
  red wines offered through 4th Street Cellars which includes tip. Fees are
  collected at the venue by Co-organizer Daima Phipps via cash\, Venmo\, or
  Paypal. You are welcome to purchase wine separately if you choose. Starti
 ng March 2025\, we ask that every attending member pay a $1 "slush" fund f
 ee per event so that we can build up our funds for club-related expenses\,
  which can be paid by Venmo or cash.\n\nThere is no food offered\, but you
  are welcome to bring an appetizer or snack to share with the group\, and 
 many ladies do. We will have time to socialize while tasting in the room u
 pstairs to the left or the outside patio if the weather is nice.\n\nThe sp
 ace has a 25 person attendee limit\, but the list is open to 40 to elimina
 te a waitlist\, and guests are welcome! Please RSVP below only if you are 
 able to make it\, we have an attendance policy: if you No-Show to three ev
 ents\, you may not attend events for the next three months. Please put thi
 s event in your calendar so you don't miss out or get dinged. A No-Show is
  when you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show up.\n\nSee you there\,
  ready to kickoff!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /312553964/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20251223T201148Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20251223T201148Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_314982900@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044829Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T170000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260714T200000
SUMMARY: Tuesdays in the Plaza at Healdsburg Town Square
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nCome celebrate summer
  in Sonoma County with us by attending a musical concert by the Rock/Count
 ry band Dustin Sailor and the Stowaways in Healdsburg town square. All mem
 bers and guests welcome!\n\nTheir weekly summer concerts in the Healdsburg
  Plaza from 6:00 p.m. to 8:00 p.m. provide an eclectic and unique line-up 
 of bands\, and have been assembled to please a wide array of musical inter
 ests. Food vendors will be on-hand to offer locally sourced food for sale 
 starting at 5:00 p.m. with the music beginning at 6:00 p.m. While enjoying
  Tuesdays in the Plaza\, they ask that you follow their [Concert Rules](ht
 tps://www.ci.healdsburg.ca.us/DocumentCenter/View/11869/Tuesdays-in-the-Pl
 aza----Concert-Rules).\n\nWe plan to meet in the town square/plaza with ou
 r chairs and blankets around 5 pm (you can even set up earlier if you wish
 ). Everyone is responsible for their own food and drink\, as they have ven
 dors available to purchase from. This is a low-key gathering to enjoy wine
 \, food and music right in our backyard.\n\nHere is the link to Healdsburg
 's website that explains it further: https://www.ci.healdsburg.ca.us/335/T
 uesdays-in-the-Plaza\n\nCheers!\n\nJoleen
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /314982900/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260527T193706Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260527T193706Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_315201966@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044829Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260715T210000
SUMMARY:Give 'Em the Arrow Again!  Ladies Night at the Archery Range
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nI'm super excited to 
 be able to offer another ladies' Archery night in Santa Rosa! If you've ev
 er had a curiosity about archery\, this is your chance to find out more wi
 th a fun\, interactive lesson.\n\nWe have reserved a special event with th
 e indoor range on a Wednesday evening. It will consist of a basic lesson\,
  and then we all get to practice shooting. Everyone will get ample time to
  practice\, as they have many lanes.\n\nThis event is focused on a less-co
 mpetitive\, relaxed\, and entertaining atmosphere. All skill levels are en
 couraged. All equipment is provided by them\, and we will probably get abo
 ut an hour or hour and a half to practice.\n\nI encourage everyone to brin
 g a bottle of wine or a snack to share with the rest of the group (We usua
 lly end up with a lovely charcuterie and wine spread for everyone to enjoy
 ). Closed toe shoes recommended.\n\nThere are 17 spots available\, guests 
 welcome. The ladies' group lesson and event is $31 per person\, with $6 pr
 epaid via Paypal and $25 paid to the range.\nPlease only RSVP 'Yes' if you
  are able to make it\, hostess Dai Phipps will be collecting a $6 fee via 
 Paypal to hold your spot. Paypal should lead you to make your payment afte
 r you RSVP 'Yes'.\n\nThere is an attendance policy for all our events: if 
 you No-Show to three events\, you may not attend events for the next three
  months. Please put this event in your calendar so you don't miss out or g
 et dinged. A No-Show is when you are on the 'Going' list\, but do not show
  up.\n\nCheers\, and hope to see you there!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /315201966/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260610T184950Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260610T184950Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Women's Wine Club
UID:event_314741409@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260618T044829Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T163000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260721T180000
SUMMARY:Special Wine Tasting at Baldassari Wine Lounge
DESCRIPTION:Sonoma County Women's Wine Club (SCWWC)\nJoin us for a special
 \, small event in the heart of Wine Country.\n\nI have the pleasure of set
 ting up a fantastic wine tasting at Baldassari Wine Lounge in Windsor duri
 ng a week night.\n\nIf you haven't been to Baldassari\, you are in for a t
 reat. They are a cute and intimate tasting room open to the public\, and t
 hey specialize in several varietals. We will be doing a flight of 5 differ
 ent wines. You are welcome to purchase wine\, chocolate\, or charcuterie o
 utside of the tasting provided.\n\nThere is a maximum of 8 spots available
 \, your spot is reserved by pre-paying for your tasting. Daima Phipps will
  be following up with Venmo/Paypal instructions if you RSVP 'Yes'.\n\nThe 
 cost of the event is $31\, which includes the wine tasting\, plus our club
  slush fund fee of $1. They will waive the tasting fee with the purchase o
 f wine\, or by becoming members of their wine club.\n\nGuests are welcome.
  We will confirm headcount about a week before.\n\nCheers to this fun rela
 xing event!
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/sonoma-county-womens-wine-club/events
 /314741409/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260511T230620Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260511T230620Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
